<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect each connector of the instrument panel junction block assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.32in"/>
